# The emitter's working directory. Its CONTENT is not committed — the committed artifact is
# docs/.interchange/ below — so this is build output like any other.
/_build/

# The committed interchange artifact (docs/dag/pr-dag.json -> ContentFormat). It IS tracked:
# the site consumes committed JSON and nothing else (invariant 18), and `docs-format-check.sh`
# gates it by byte-equality against a fresh parse. Note `*.md` above does not reach it — these
# are .json — but `!docs/**` is what keeps the directory itself visible if that ever changes.
